Clarifications on Output and External Assets
============================================

- Generated sprites (PNG/JSON outputs produced by running the generator) are
  unrestricted and may be used in commercial or non-commercial projects without
  attribution.
- External fonts or third-party assets fetched at runtime (e.g., Press Start 2P
  from Google Fonts during build_itch_assets.py) remain subject to their own
  upstream licenses (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
